{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0097502 mannosylation\nsee (https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30359)\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/11qFkpZTEGqPjHukzQ9VU9Y2B2p_UmljM2ov1fXtt50Y/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nComplexPortal 1\nGOC 1\nGeneDB 1\nUniProt 3\n\nThere are 10 experimental annotations to GO:0035368\nCGD 6\nComplexPortal 1\nGeneDB 1\nMGI 1\nHGNC-UCL 1 - changed - assuming protein O-linked mannosylation term will be kept\nUniProt 1 \n\nNo mappings that need to be reviewed\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-06-16T20:58:55Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0097502 mannosylation GO:0035268 protein mannosylation", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-11-12T00:52:44Z"}
